      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../core/support/RepositoryComposition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition</code></a> for this repository.",
      "translation": "返回此存储库的<a href=\"../core/support/RepositoryComposition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the target class method that is backing the given method. This can be necessary if a repository interface\nredeclares a method of the core repository interface (e.g. for transaction behavior customization). Returns the\nmethod itself if the target class does not implement the given method. Implementations need to make sure the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> returned can be invoked via reflection, i.e. needs to be accessible.",
      "translation": "返回给定方法所对应的目标类方法。如果存储库接口重新声明了核心存储库接口的某个方法（例如用于事务行为定制），则此操作可能是必要的。如果目标类未实现给定方法，则返回该方法本身。实现方需确保通过反射调用的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>是可访问的，即需要具有可访问性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../core/support/RepositoryComposition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition</code></a> for this repository. This is used to determine the composition of the\nrepository and its fragments.",
      "translation": "返回此存储库的<a href=\"../core/support/RepositoryComposition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition</code></a>。该对象用于确定存储库及其片段的组成情况。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the target class method that is backing the given method.",
      "translation": "返回给定方法所对应的目标类方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given method is logically a base class method.",
      "translation": "返回给定的方法在逻辑上是否为基类方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given method is logically a base class method. This also includes methods (re)declared in the\nrepository interface that match the signatures of the base implementation.",
      "translation": "返回给定的方法在逻辑上是否为基类方法。这还包括在存储库接口中（重新）声明且与基实现签名匹配的方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>method</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>method</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
